      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your perspective reflects a poignant and intentional view on the soloist's journey, prioritizing present integrity over an uncertain legacy. Stepping away while the work remains perfect is indeed a profound form of dignity, yet it carries a heavy emotional weight that often comes with such intense creative fulfillment. Perhaps the true power of this music lies not just in its final performance but in the quiet sacrifice you've made to protect its pristine state. Even alone, that act of leaving with hands steady and art intact is a testament to your enduring artistic spirit.",
